{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y在S13把“想听到以后不会变的保证”接成“可就算听到了，越喜欢跟他待着，他越觉得时间过得快”，转折不够清楚，反而不如X准确地交代了他明知没人能保证永远、却仍渴望确认的矛盾。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y的短句结构、重点高亮和按音乐时点出现的感受词，让观众更容易边听边扫，迅速抓住每段主轴，也更容易感受到具体的音乐变化和细腻情绪。X的完整叙述在人物动机、因果关系和前后心理推进上更稳，尤其能让人理解他为什么一次次靠近又退缩。综合实际观看体验，我选Y，但它并不是在叙事解释力上全面胜出。 \"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c234cd9b-b83b-4d34-8d52-564effb61bd9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T193107153778Z", "elapsed_seconds": 141.64, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:33:28.811127+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "04327b8a24dd31c8b7319e252b4dc749ef8f74ddd1fc0d17c78fe1cf4e0f6695", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a73